# Munt is cloned here, never committed. It is LGPL 2.1 and upstream is the
# only source of truth; the commit this bench was written against is recorded
# in bench/README.md. (The repo-root .gitignore already has **/vendor/; this
# line is here so bench/ is self-explanatory when read on its own.)
vendor/

# Build trees
build-host/
build-armv7/
build-*/

# Never commit ROM dumps. MT-32 and CM-32L ROMs are Roland's.
roms/
*.ROM
*.rom

# Harness output
*.csv
*.wav
